roperly. Then I can help with their requests.\n\nFor the t-shirt question, I would need to:\n1. List all product types to find t-shirts\n2. Get product details for t-shirt products\n3. Find the cheapest available item\n\nBut first, I need to authenticate the user.\n\nLet me start by asking for their email to authenticate them.\n</think>\n\nHello there! 😄 I'm here to help you out, but before we dive into any fun business, I need to make sure I'm talking to the right person. Could you please share your email address so I can verify your account? That's my security protocol - gotta keep things legit! 🕵️‍♀️\n\nOnce I've got that sorted, I can definitely help you update your address from Florida to Phoenix and check out those t-shirt prices. And hey, if you've got some good jokes up your sleeve, I'm all ears! Just don't tell me you're wearing a t-shirt made entirely of punchlines... that'd be hilarious! 😂",
